# res://dialogue/test_chapter_intro.dialogue
# Intro conversation for chapter 2 played over the portal swirl.

~ start
do change_background("test", "none", 0.0)
do show_cg("sergey_neutral", "fade", 0.5)
Sergey: You arrive. I was beginning to think the memory would remain locked.
do show_cg("sergey_hand_up")
Sergey: This is where it all started, da? The day we met in the clinic.
do show_cg("sergey_frown")
Sergey: But do not let your guard down. Things are not always as they seem.
do show_cg("sergey_eyes_closed")
Sergey: Take a deep breath. Focus on the details. Let us begin.
do hide_cg("fade", 0.5)
=> END
